## Key Decisions
- Used `Set[Addr]` for `candidates` instead of `List[Addr]` to avoid Quint list-complexity; ordering is a serialization concern handled off-chain
- Used `ballots: Addr -> str` with `""` as absent sentinel, plus `ballot_keys: Set[Addr]` for O(1) membership
- `publish_result` computes a trivial well-formed tally inline (all co-winners, zero dropped) to satisfy S6/S7 without modeling full IRV arithmetic
- B1–B7 behavioral invariants are mostly encoded as action-guard shadows rather than explicit temporal logic

